{
 "app": "tv-settings",
 "title": "Settings on TV",
 "about": "Settings in TV posture (SUNO_POSTURE=tv, SunoUI's TV frame) against the Design Center's TV mockup at 1920x1080: the floating island open and folded to its rail, grouped rows, chip rows, a choice list and a field taking the TV keyboard (the keyboard is the Shell's). The island must be as tall as its rows (pair \"island\"). Dark only: a TV is always dark.",
